cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Short Rate Anomaly Regimes
message: Please cite this repository and the replicated article.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Research compendium reconstructing and extending the two-factor ICAPM of Maio
  and Santa-Clara (2017), in which the pricing factors are the market excess
  return and the innovation in a short-term interest rate. Every estimate is a
  documented reconstruction rather than an exact replication, because the article
  names data providers rather than files.
authors:
